  "definition": "Application for a Shop License",
  "effectiveDate": "2015-04-02",
  "historyNote": "#6577, eff 9-13-97 (from Bar 302.03); ss by #7555, eff 9-12-01; ss by #8655, eff 6-9-06; amd by #8753, eff 11-27-06; amd by #9047, eff 12-12-07; amd by #9455-B, eff 4-14-09; amd by #9652, eff 2-3-10; ss by #10412-B, eff 9-19-13; ss by #10653, eff 8-7-14; ss by #10808, eff 4-2-15",
